module stratamerkle

; Canonical Merkle decomposition.
;
; This layer adds no primitive and widens nothing. The chunking rule, the
; chunk identities and the incremental root are Strata's own --
; `strata/system/merkle.strata` -- and the only thing Meta contributes is
; the source list the checks link.

judgment StrataMerkleSystem [prelude native octets artifact collections merkle] =
  list [prelude native octets artifact collections merkle]
